<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>I love her.\'a0 She takes drugs all of the time via "drug patches"\'a0 I was going to describe an advance in patching technology - electronic patches that instead of drugs, use electronic manipulation of brain chemistry.\'a0 (Sort of commenting on Jeremy Bentham's "pushpin v poetry" proposition.)\'a0 She is also a very good Dr and works as a pathologist so she can "patch up" as much as possible.
